<title>BRAZIL: Brazil markets to close Thurs for Corpus Christi.</title>
<headline>Brazil markets to close Thurs for Corpus Christi.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial markets will be closed Thursday for the Corpus Christi holiday.</p>
<p>Local stock and futures exchanges will reopen as normal on Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
